        "type": "writing",
        "title": "The chart below shows the different levels of post-school qualifications in Australia and the proportion of men and women who held them in 1999. Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features and make comparisons where relevant.",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KoesdWrRjoYJPQxexOLlUMIGgBz\"><em><strong>The chart below shows the different levels of post-school qualifications in Australia and the proportion of men and women who held them in 1999. Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">IELTS Writing Task 1 - Post-School Qualifications in Australia: 1999</p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TEHWdgInZoKzoXx3Pa1lj5QMgLc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Đề b&agrave;i Post-School Qualifications in Australia: 1999 y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả về c&aacute;c cấp độ bằng cấp phổ th&ocirc;ng kh&aacute;c nhau sau phổ th&ocirc;ng (tr&igrave;nh độ học vấn sau trung học) ở &Uacute;c v&agrave; tỷ lệ nam giới v&agrave; nữ giới sở hữu c&aacute;c bằng cấp n&agrave;y trong năm 1999.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N64jd9FvgoRfDTx2p91lBNjJgRc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TqPldEHP5oO9Eqxr2kRlefpxgtb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KJIDd23oMoldbUxAfnilBuFRgNd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Bạn n&ecirc;n học c&aacute;ch <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/so-lieu-tuong-doi\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">tả số liệu 'tương đối' &amp; paraphrase cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u</a></strong></span> trước khi viết b&agrave;i &rarr;<strong>&nbsp;</strong>đ&acirc;y l&agrave; kỹ năng viết v&ocirc; c&ugrave;ng quan trọng để d&ugrave;ng trong cả b&agrave;i viết.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-V2KUdr10HoS97zxVv0ilC6U1g9d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề Post-School Qualifications in Australia: 1999 với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: c&aacute;c cấp độ bằng cấp kh&aacute;c nhau - sau khi tốt nghiệp trung học phổ th&ocirc;ng - tỷ lệ nam nữ sở hữu c&aacute;c bằng cấp n&agrave;y - &Uacute;c - năm 1999</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKcrd7u17ogCsex6cUPlJ2cCgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DPopdJolqo778Mx1rAWlfHghgeh\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề kh&ocirc;ng thay đổi theo thời gian, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ đề cập đến 2 th&ocirc;ng tin ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JXCHdeBGLo4GJ6xqDZ1lzqxfgsg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Nam chiếm ưu thế ở 2 mức bằng cấp c&oacute; khoảng c&aacute;ch ch&ecirc;nh lệch lớn nhất (Skilled Vocational Diploma v&agrave; Postgraduate Diploma)</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AIO4d7V8UoIj6CxFpwQlffKwgCe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Nữ chiếm đa số ở bậc Undergraduate Diploma</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZrvgdhtrQovJnNxqKVSl5FLhgxe\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch gom c&aacute;c hạng mục c&oacute; sự tương đồng, cụ thể như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CpWhdSGJFoye2PxbbFelCRADg5e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Rz0NddrmjoHn8jxmey6lnsQZgpg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> Skilled Vocational Diploma Undergraduate Diploma, v&agrave; Bachelor's Degree</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MEEfdUp33osdl1xqj5xlq1BigBT\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QVo4d768Moll4ax3zXYlT80Mguh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh tỷ lệ nam v&agrave; nữ sở hữu Skilled Vocational Diploma </strong><em>(90% vs 10%)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JyjedlFzRoDbvSxxxW8lABHLgse\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>So s&aacute;nh tỷ lệ nam v&agrave; nữ sở hữu Undergraduate Diploma </strong><em>(35% vs 75%)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RFtPdasljoY0EJxWfvLlZQsIgob\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>So s&aacute;nh tỷ lệ nam v&agrave; nữ sở hữu Bachelor's Degree </strong><em>(45% vs 50%)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EwzTddSWRoqDSGxM4hFlvPg1grc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C1HtdpnMHoRGDdx61HjlSfiEg2c\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2:</strong><strong> Postgraduate Diploma v&agrave; Masters Degree</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HpKcd85c3oltQBxND4rlAwcIgBc\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PDAfd5491ooXH5xAqZslh2pygwj\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh tỷ lệ nam v&agrave; nữ sở hữu Postgraduate Diploma </strong><em>(70% vs 30%)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C8QcdGAlzoxSKFxPo3UlPbgFgkg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>So s&aacute;nh tỷ lệ nam v&agrave; nữ sở hữu Master's Diploma </strong><em>(60% vs 40%)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TOGCdDfzMo4b0vxNcTDlMZwkgW6\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FASwd2UiCoitfbxeuYllUMqJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bc2gdrij0o2chcxcadllSjTsgke\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XdYcdsZ6Uo6tuXxGPs3lNnJUgHh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HE29dhmJjod0qix8V1qlgw9gggc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TrbVdaf9Uo9kPOx1rKUlKHPHgXg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Khi muốn diễn đạt \"<strong>ai đ&oacute; sở hữu bằng cấp\"</strong>, thay v&igrave; d&ugrave;ng \"<strong>hold a degree/ diploma</strong>\" ch&uacute;ng ta c&oacute; thể paraphrase d&ugrave;ng cụm danh từ \"<strong>degree/ diploma holders\"</strong> để đa dạng c&aacute;c c&acirc;u của m&igrave;nh hơn nh&eacute;.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RYptd0omgoLj5nxI0oalIUpFgsf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bdo8dnWObo35jjxAjXhlauOygkb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>V&iacute; dụ:</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XH3RdTegyolmVvx8F5LlNQGDg1b\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">The largest disparity between the sexes was seen in the lowest qualification level, with 90% of <strong>skilled vocational diploma holders</strong> being men and 10% being women.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 261,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NzCgdqNcNoEgk3x7PbPl0wszgwc\">The given bar chart gives information about the qualifications of Australian men and women in 1999.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13679,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 262,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PM5IdE15goH9CyxynqElY6uYgqh\">Overall, it is clear men dominated the two extremes of the educational spectrum, while women made up the majority of undergraduate qualification holders.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13679,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 263,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-EVS4d4HUPo51AZxIk9RlkkjXgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DKeldK9tAoAbLOxVbNCl0O9Gg6d\">Looking at the first three qualifications, there was a stark contrast in the Skilled Vocational Diploma holders, with males accounting for approximately 90% compared to just 10% for females. By contrast, women comprised around 75% of those with Undergraduate Diplomas, nearly double the proportion of men at 35%. The gender distribution was more balanced for Bachelor's Degrees, though females still held a slight advantage at 50% versus 45% for males.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13679,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 264,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HQtwdghrNo3YPexdh29l5ptAgUc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DLIAd6bKpo13lLxHTg5lrX2Ogab\">Regarding the remaining qualifications, men made up about 70% of Postgraduate Diploma holders, more than twice the percentage of women at 30%. Meanwhile, the gender gap narrowed for Master's Degrees, with males representing roughly 60% compared to 40% for females.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13679,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
        ],
        "writing_graph_image": "98d6d6f2-01ac-47ae-a584-1b83dc621a87",
        "writing_graph_description": "1. Chart Description: \nChart type: Bar chart\nTitle: Post-School Qualifications in Australia 1999\nTime period: 1999\nUnits: Percentage (%)\nAxes: x-axis: Percentage (0-100%), y-axis: Qualification types\nCategories/Groups: Gender (Male and Female), Qualification types (Skilled Vocational Diploma, Undergraduate Diploma, Bachelor's Degree, Postgraduate Diploma, Masters Degree)\n2. Data in CSV format: \nQualification,Female,Male\nSkilled Vocational Diploma,10,90\nUndergraduate Diploma,70,35\nBachelor's Degree,50,45\nPostgraduate Diploma,30,70\nMasters Degree,40,60",
